{"version":1,"content":"<p>HMD Global近日推出了一款名為Nokia 2360 Flip的翻蓋式功能手機，主要面向老年人、學生以及希望擺脱智能手機複雜功能的用户。新機延續了諾基亞經典翻蓋手機的設計，同時加入遠程家庭管理、緊急求助按鈕和兒童使用限制等功能，試圖讓傳統功能機具備更多家庭安全管理能力。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584440.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:04:32.760585+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T07:25:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:59:01.280889+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T07:59:01.280889+00:00","content_hash":"761d0158a195a6dc744c29222ce2d4fc9bd38165c66f7ff94e6612d33ef253df","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}